5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I keep seeing invoices for things we didn't budget for. I want to know where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We plan as if we have the staff we had five years ago. I need to know who is actually working.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The shows we are proud of on paper are not the ones people return for. The record should speak.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building has limits. I need to know what the floor and structure can actually absorb before we promise anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"We always get caught out by delivery. I want to know where past seasons actually came unstuck, not where they were meant to.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that sounds right. If the staff is thin, the costs will be hidden in overtime or extra hires.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, exactly. I am looking at the roster and the lab backlog. Who is doing the work?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, structural limits are important, but if the content is boring, no one comes back. I will check the visitor data.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, if the floor cracks, the content doesn't matter. I will check the structural survey and the maintenance logs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. I will look at the lender paperwork and the transport costs. Those are where the delays start.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges. Those are the quiet budget eaters.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster. I need to see the real capacity.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look at the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips. I want to see what brings them back.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs. I want to see the delays.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Okay, let's see what we find. I hope the numbers make sense this time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's hope the data is clear. I don't want to guess again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,The data will tell the truth. Let's see if it matches our pride.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The building will tell the truth. Let's see if it can hold what we want.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,The paperwork will tell the truth. Let's see if we can deliver on time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
