35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Whoa, transport is a third of installation costs? And joiner rates are up half? That explains the budget gaps.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. And the volunteers are mostly the history circle. We are stretched thin.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. Head counts go up when things move or change. And people come back because someone is there, working or talking.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The bay is capped at 400kg per square metre. And powered displays had seventeen call-outs, four during opening hours. That is a problem.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Ah, so two openings slipped because paperwork came back late. And transport is eating the budget. I knew it was the delivery.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, yes! The transport costs are huge. If we choose something with lots of loans, we are in trouble.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, and if we choose something that needs conservation, we are in even more trouble. The lab is empty.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, so if we choose something heavy or powered, we risk the structure and the maintenance. But if we choose something static, people won't come back.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, exactly. We need something that is light, static, but still engaging. Or we need to accept the risks.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, @Victoria, this is why we get caught out. We approve in good faith, then apologize at the door.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So, we need to avoid heavy loans and powered displays. But we also need something that brings people back.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,And we need something that doesn't require a full conservation team. The lab is a ghost town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,The comment slips say people want to see someone working or talking. Maybe a demonstration?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A demonstration could be light and static. But we need to be careful about the space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,A demonstration could work. But we need to make sure the delivery is smooth. No more late paperwork.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think we are getting closer. Let's see the candidates.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see if any of them fit our constraints.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see if any of them bring people back.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see if any of them fit the building.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's see if any of them can be delivered on time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
