60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A looks perfect for the budget. Local items mean no transport costs, and demonstrations mean no heavy mounts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A is also good for staffing. The craftspeople can do the work, and the volunteers can guide. No conservation backlog.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A has demonstrations. That matches the comment slips. People want to see someone working.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is light. Garments and tools are not heavy. No powered displays. The structure is safe.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A is local. No distant lenders. No late paperwork. No transport delays. This is the one.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, yes! No transport costs, no late paperwork. It fits everything.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, and it fits the staffing. The craftspeople are the staff.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, and it fits the structure. Light and static.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, and it fits the maintenance. No powered displays.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, and it fits the delivery. Local and simple.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,What about Option B? Light and Motion.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Option B is bad for staffing. It needs technical staff for the lights and motion. We don't have them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Option B has motion. That might bring people back. But the comment slips say people want to see someone working, not just lights.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Option B is bad for the structure. Overhead rigging and kinetic works are heavy and risky.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,Option B is bad for delivery. Artist studios are distant. Paperwork will be late.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,Option C? Maritime Trade Routes.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Option C is bad for conservation. Ship models and cargo objects need cleaning. The lab is empty.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,Option C is static. Charts and models. People might not come back.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Option C is heavy. Ship models and stonework. The bay is capped at 400kg.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Option C is bad for delivery. Partner maritime collections are distant. Paperwork will be late.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
